/li></ul><script type=\"text/javascript\">new I.GameUserTools('#user_tools')</script><div id=\"wrapper\" class=\"main wrapper game_page_wrapper\"><div id=\"inner_column\" class=\"inner_column size_large family_kulim-park\"><div class=\"header align_center has_image\" id=\"header\"><img alt=\"Lucid Cats\" src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzMwMzc2MTk0LmpwZw==/original/NDxeUQ.jpg\"/><h1 itemprop=\"name\" class=\"game_title\">Lucid Cats</h1></div><div class=\"view_game_page page_widget base_widget buy_on_top\" id=\"view_game_1474642\"><div class=\"header_buy_row\"><p>A downloadable game for Windows</p><div class=\"buy_row\"><div class=\"button_message\"><a href=\"https://llewellitp.itch.io/lucid-cats/purchase\" class=\"button buy_btn\">Download Now</a><span class=\"buy_message\"><span class=\"sub\">Name your own price</span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><p>Lucid Cats is an online co-op horror game for up to four players featuring creepy monsters, liminal procedurally generated dream levels, and proximity voice chat.</p>\r\n<div>\r\n  <img src=\"https://s15.gifyu.com/images/bQs67.gif\" alt=\"Gameplay\" width=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\">\r\n</div>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\">\uD83D\uDC3E <strong>Play with friends:</strong> Lucid Cats uses invite-only lobbies. Host a game and invite up to three friends through Steam. There is currently no public matchmaking. Solo play is also supported.&nbsp;\uD83D\uDC3E</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<div>\r\n  <img src=\"https://s15.gifyu.com/images/bQs6q.gif\" alt=\"Gameplay\" width=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\">\r\n</div>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<ul><li><strong>FALL ASLEEP</strong>\r\n<p>Wake together in a shared dream: weird, nostalgic, and full of valuables to take.\r\n</p></li><li><strong>LOOT THE DREAM</strong>\r\n<p>Valuables are instantly credited to you. However, you can only keep them if you find the dream exit and meet the quota.\r\n</p></li><li><strong>PROCEDURAL LEVELS + SECURITY CAMERAS</strong>\r\n</li></ul>\r\n<div>\r\n  <img src=\"https://s15.gifyu.com/images/bQs69.gif\" alt=\"Gameplay\" width=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\">\r\n</div>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<ul><li>A weirdcore, dreamcore descent into places that are nostalgic, unsettling, and laid out differently every time.\r\n</li><li><strong>LAPTOP UPGRADES</strong>\r\n<p>Security cameras, valuable trackers, and more: your Laptop is your best friend for navigating the dream world and succeeding with your friends.\r\n</p></li><li><strong>FIND THE EXIT</strong>\r\n<p>Use proximity voice chat to guide each other and stay immersed. Find the exit to keep your haul. If you die in the dream, you wake with nothing.</p></li></ul>\r\n<div>\r\n  <img src=\"https://s15.gifyu.com/images/bQs6E.gif\" alt=\"Gameplay\" width=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\">\r\n</div></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" class=\"toggle_info_btn\">More information<svg aria-hidden viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\" version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\" width=\"12\" height=\"6\" role=\"img\"><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1.9331-0.577 0-1.111 0.23008-1.49 0.57992l-14.924 13.894-14.925-13.893c-0.3777-0.34998-0.9134-0.581-1.4902-0.581z\"/></svg></a></div><div class=\"info_panel_wrapper\"><div class=\"game_info_panel_widget base_widget\" id=\"game_info_panel_4811427\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Published</td><td><abbr title=\"29 September 2026 @ 14:48 UTC\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-stopwatch\"></span> 3 hours ago</abbr></td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/released\">Released</a></td></tr><tr><td>Platforms</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/platform-windows\">Windows</a></td></tr><tr><td>Rating</td><td><div data-tooltip=\"5.00 average rating from 